  "instructions": [
    "Rinse black rice under cold water until water runs clear.",
    "Heat olive oil in a wok over medium heat and sauté onion and garlic until translucent.",
    "Add sliced bell pepper and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in squid rings and cook until they curl slightly.",
    "Add anchovy fillets, smoked paprika, HP sauce, and fish stock, bringing to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add the rinsed black rice, cover, and cook for 18 minutes until rice is tender and liquid absorbed.",
    "Lay parchment paper on a bamboo tray, sprinkle with flour, transfer the paella mixture onto the tray, and seal the edges to en-croute.",
    "Bake at 375°F for 12 minutes, then serve garnished with chopped parsley."
  ],
